      value: "In der englischen Sprache gibt es zwei W\xF6rter f\xFCr ein und dasselbe:\r\n
        \r\n1. pigeon\r\na fat grey and white bird with short legs. Pigeons are common
        in cities and also live in woods and fields where people shoot them for sport
        or food.\r\n \r\n2. dove\r\na bird of the pigeon family. The white dove is
        often used as a symbol of peace.\r\n"
